  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets. <br>• Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks. <br>• Slice brown onion into thick wedges.<br>• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season  <br>with salt. Toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6931196a24f7e56250a348be/step-c6c83d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.<br>• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.<br>• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.<br>• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6931196a24f7e56250a348be/step-0a9d1410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook mild curry paste until fragrant, 1 min.<br>• Add coconut milk and the water (for the curry). Bring to a simmer, then add <br>roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves, tossing until wilted and combined, <br>1 min. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6931196a24f7e56250a348be/step-3132bc20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide garlic rice and roast cauliflower korma curry between bowls to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6931196a24f7e56250a348be/step-eb021d30.jpg"
    }
  ]
